            518.16
          ],
          "intersectsDrawing": false,
          "fonts": [
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            11.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "properties of the modular form following a method of Lawrence and Zagier [23]. A key observation",
