          "fonts": [
            "CMMI12",
            "CMR12",
            "Times-Roman"
          ],
          "sizes": [
            11.96
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "suggested in Ref. 23. Using a nearly modular property of the Eichler integral, we can derive an",
